{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026q2DSmWWf3t1794909670.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>藍田啟田邨有單位發生火警，兩人吸入濃煙不適送院，初步調查火警無可疑。</p><p></p><p>從網上片段可見，啟旺樓高層單位不斷冒出濃煙，有火舌從單位噴出。消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊撲救。火警撲熄後，幾層外牆都被熏黑。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.LT-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F0JG0l50Gr1794909679.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防下午近兩時接報，啟田邨啟旺樓有單位起火，初步調查相信單位主人房起火，懷疑由電路故障引起。男女戶主自行逃生，兩人吸入濃煙不適，送往聯合醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.LT-1630_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026px00NOnSj61794909691.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防破門進入單位後，發現一隻貓昏迷，替牠急救，再交由愛護動物協會救治。火警期間，約二百人自行疏散。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.554581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:59:06.193418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:43.325084+00:00","content_hash":"20cbbd3e34d1d244f20b69e4711afb347dfb1150fc62c6562063c007e07111b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.554581+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}